## Summary of Design Decisions

| Decision | Why |
|----------|-----|
| **In-memory array** | No external dependencies; easy to understand and run locally |
| **Custom error classes** | Consistent JSON error responses; distinguishes client vs. server errors |
| **Centralized error middleware** | One place for all error handling; prevents leaking stack traces |
| **Async/await on routes** | Modern pattern; ready for database integration without rewriting |
| **Separate route files** | Scalable architecture; each resource has its own module |
| **JSDoc everywhere** | Self-documenting code; works with IDE autocomplete and documentation generators |
| **Helmet + CORS + Compression** | Production-grade middleware for security, cross-origin support, and performance |
| **Validation before processing** | Fails fast with clear error messages instead of letting bad data through |

