# 📚 Book REST API

An educational, fully-commented REST API built with Node.js and Express.js that manages a collection of books in memory.

## Features

- ✅ Full CRUD operations on books (Create, Read, Update, Delete)
- ✅ Query-based filtering (by genre, author, year range)
