# Book REST API

An educational RESTful API built with Node.js and Express.js that manages a collection of books. This project demonstrates core backend engineering concepts including CRUD operations, filtering, error handling, and REST conventions.

## Features

- **CRUD Operations**: Full Create, Read, Update, Delete support for books
- **Filtering**: Query parameters to filter by genre, author, and minimum rating
- **Statistics**: Aggregate analytics about the book collection
- **Error Handling**: Custom error classes with consistent JSON error responses
- **Validation**: Request body validation with descriptive error messages

## Prerequisites

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) (v18 or higher recommended)
- npm (comes with Node.js)

